Package: com.corpsezhao.wifirelay
Name: WiFiRelay
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: CarPlay companion: when the phone joins an internet-less hotspot (car head unit / Zlink box), actively probes it and firewalls off dead WiFi so iOS demotes it and cellular takes over automatically. CarPlay local traffic is never touched.
Maintainer: Corpse-zhao
Author: Corpse-zhao
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
